-- GAP 5: L74, L915: s 8 (Part 3) commences on 2016-01-18 => 2016-01-18.
-- GAP 6: L74, L915: s 20 (regulations) commences on 2016-01-18 => 2016-01-18.
-- GAP 7: L74-75, L915-917: s 6 commences on 2016-07-22 => 2016-07-22.
