-- GAP 9: s 6 is in force on 2016-07-21 => N.
-- GAP 10: s 6 is in force on 2016-07-22 (the commencement day itself) => Y.
-- GAP 11: s 7 is in force on 2016-01-18 => N (L74: "Except sections 6 and 7").
-- GAP 12: s 7 is in force on 2016-12-31 => Y.
-- GAP 13: s 11 is in force on 2016-01-17 (day before) => N.
-- GAP 14: s 11 is in force on 2016-01-18 => Y.
-- GAP 15: s 2 (interpretation) is in force on 2016-01-18 => Y.
-- GAP 16: The hour/minute at which the 18 January 2016 commencement takes effect => NC (R6: only a date is given).
-- GAP 17: L139, L932: the wording of the definition of "public scheme" takes effect on 2024-12-31 => 2024-12-31.
-- GAP 18: The "public scheme" wording is in force on 2024-12-31 => Y.
-- GAP 19: The "public scheme" wording is in force on 2024-12-30 => N (J: "wef 31/12/2024" says it takes effect from that date; the text does not show what applied before).
-- GAP 20: L124, L933: the amended definition of "permanent resident of Singapore" takes effect on 2025-12-01 => 2025-12-01.
-- GAP 21: The "permanent resident of Singapore" wording is in force on 2025-12-01 => Y.
-- GAP 22: The "permanent resident of Singapore" wording is in force on 2025-11-30 => N (J: same reasoning as 19).
-- GAP 23: What "permanent resident of Singapore" meant on 2025-06-01 => NC (this consolidation does not show pre-amendment text).
